{"code":"000040","name":"KR모터스","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"자동차","sector_desc":"완성차 제조. 글로벌 판매량, 환율, 관세·전동화 정책이 핵심 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1976년 유가증권시장에 상장한 이륜차 제조 전문기업으로, 당반기 중 주식회사 다이나맥을 종속기업에 포함함. 동사는 국내 유일의 250cc~700cc급 고배기량 엔진 보유 메이커로, 국내는 125cc 이하, 해외는 250cc 이상 위주로 판매 전략을 지향하고 있음. 2023년 대만 SYM社와 독점 유통계약을 체결하고, EV기종 E-LUTION과 삼륜 전기차 이스코트리 출시로 전기이륜차 시장에 대응하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":1117.0,"open":1102.0,"high":1144.0,"low":1102.0,"volume":25280,"amount":28237760.0,"ret_1d":-1.3251,"gap":-2.6502,"range_pct":3.7601,"ret_5":-10.4968,"ret_20":8.6576,"ret_60":0.2693,"ret_120":-49.457,"ret_250":-55.6746,"ma20":1058.7,"ma60":1185.3833,"ma120":1394.2833,"ma200":1671.445,"close_vs_ma200":-33.1716,"close_vs_ma60":-5.7689,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-68.7718,"r2_60":0.3971,"slope_120":-74.6339,"r2_120":0.7913,"slope_250":-60.8672,"r2_250":0.859,"high52":2830.0,"low52":0.0,"pos_52w":39.47,"dd_52w":-60.53,"mdd_1y":-62.8125,"atr14_pct":9.5025,"vol_ann_60":101.2508,"vol_avg20":146545.85,"vol_ratio20":0.1725,"vr5":0.6926,"vr20":2.0796,"amount_avg5":88591595.4,"amount_avg20":179180455.85,"amount_avg60":145241161.95,"obv_chg20":-20.1135,"turnover_20":14.8966,"pv_eff_20":0.5812,"rsi14":51.0259,"frgn_net_5":-7843.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0399,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0399,"frgn_net_20":-69226.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.3518,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.3518,"frgn_net_60":-54469.0,"inst_net_60":-8.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.2768,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.2769,"frgn_net_120":114162.0,"inst_net_120":6180.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.5802,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0314,"smart_net_120_pct":0.6116,"foreign_ratio":25.25,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-4.22,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":4.0,"op_margin_q":1.5209,"op_qoq":157.1429,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":300.0,"rev_yoy":484.4444,"op_trend_4q":66.6667,"fin_period":"202606","roe":54.83,"debt_ratio":134.07,"per":0.65,"pbr":0.27,"div_yie